Contract/version and rendered file hashes are recorded in `.aware/agent-bootstrap.json`.
That is setup provenance, not actor authorization or permanent path admission.
Upgrades require an explicitly reviewed template/version and customer acceptance;
ordinary bootstrap never silently rewrites this contract or customer instructions.
